  "description": {
    "text": "The EX Trainer Kit 2, released in Italian on 15 March 2005, came in English and other European languages only, with two half decks, Plusle and Minun. The cards carry the kit's own set symbol and number and no rarity mark. All are reprints from EX Hidden Legends, EX FireRed & LeafGreen, EX Team Rocket Returns, EX Deoxys and EX Emerald except the holo Plusle and Minun, until then only in the Japanese Mirage's Mew Constructed Starter Deck.\n\nThis set holds the Minun half deck, which runs on Fire and Lightning Energy."
  },
